# Harness: with the dialog OPEN, Alt+Tab away and back (should land back in the dialog), then close it
# and Alt+Tab away and back, then a title change.
w 0.5
k {ENTER}
w 4
k %{TAB}
w 4
k %{TAB}
w 5
e Dialog List
k {ESC}
w 4
k %{TAB}
w 4
k %{TAB}
w 5
e! HARNESS DIALOG LABEL
k {ESC}
w 4
e! HARNESS DIALOG LABEL
